#: apps/accounts/templates/accounts/register.html:102
msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_modal_title"
msgstr "Privacy Policy"

#: apps/accounts/templates/accounts/register.html:105
msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_modal_intro"
msgstr ""
"This policy explains how your information is processed when you create an "
"account, join an organization, and use courses, exams, labs, assignments, "
"and live session features inside EMSArena."

#: apps/accounts/templates/accounts/register.html:108
#: apps/accounts/templates/accounts/register.html:211
msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_close"
msgstr "Close"

#: apps/accounts/templates/accounts/register.html:115
msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_modal_summary_badge"
msgstr "Short and clear summary"

#: apps/accounts/templates/accounts/register.html:118
msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_modal_summary"
msgstr ""
"Your data is used to create your account, keep sign-in secure, manage "
"organization membership, and run the platform's teaching features. Your data "
"is not sold and is only shared when necessary to provide the service."

#: apps/accounts/templates/accounts/register.html:129
msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_section_data_title"
msgstr "What we collect"

#: apps/accounts/templates/accounts/register.html:132
msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_section_data_body"
msgstr ""
"During signup we collect your username, first name, last name, email, "
"country, selected account type, and organization details. As you use the "
"platform, operational records related to courses, exams, labs, assignments, "
"results, and membership activity may also be generated."

#: apps/accounts/templates/accounts/register.html:143
msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_section_use_title"
msgstr "How we use it"

#: apps/accounts/templates/accounts/register.html:146
msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_section_use_body"
msgstr ""
"This data is used to create your account, send email OTP verification, "
"manage workspace and organization access, run course and exam flows, show "
"results, and support auditing and security controls."

#: apps/accounts/templates/accounts/register.html:157
msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_section_access_title"
msgstr "Visibility inside organizations"

#: apps/accounts/templates/accounts/register.html:160
msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_section_access_body"
msgstr ""
"If you join a school, university, or course center, authorized admins and "
"teachers in that organization may see your basic profile details, membership "
"status, and learning activity relevant to your role."

#: apps/accounts/templates/accounts/register.html:171
msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_section_sharing_title"
msgstr "Who data is shared with"

#: apps/accounts/templates/accounts/register.html:174
msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_section_sharing_body"
msgstr ""
"Your information is not sold. It may be shared only with authorized managers "
"in the organization you select, technical providers that support services "
"such as email verification or hosting, and relevant parties when required by "
"law."

#: apps/accounts/templates/accounts/register.html:185
msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_section_retention_title"
msgstr "Retention and security"

#: apps/accounts/templates/accounts/register.html:188
msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_section_retention_body"
msgstr ""
"Information is retained for as long as it is needed to operate the service, "
"support audits, and investigate disputes. Sensitive flows such as OTP "
"verification are short-lived, and technical and organizational security "
"measures are applied across the system."

#: apps/accounts/templates/accounts/register.html:199
msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_section_rights_title"
msgstr "Your rights"

#: apps/accounts/templates/accounts/register.html:202
msgctxt "accounts.register"
msgid "privacy_section_rights_body"
msgstr ""
"You can update your profile details, change your organization choices, and "
"request clarification or deletion related to your account data. You can "
"contact the platform administrator to exercise these rights."

